{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01434",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.76,
      "end_seconds": 6.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "Hi, sit anywhere you like. What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.5,
      "end_seconds": 16.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Yeah, it's my face drooping on one side. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.58,
      "end_seconds": 23.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.49,
      "end_seconds": 31.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "around three weeks... no wait, it's more like about a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.68,
      "end_seconds": 35.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.5,
      "end_seconds": 42.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Maybe a seven out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.4,
      "end_seconds": 47.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.9,
      "end_seconds": 55.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "mm, when it starts I tend to get a sudden headache as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.85,
      "end_seconds": 58.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "what about seizure?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.01,
      "end_seconds": 60.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Nope, no seizure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.34,
      "end_seconds": 64.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever or loss of consciousness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.47,
      "end_seconds": 69.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.12,
      "end_seconds": 74.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.65,
      "end_seconds": 77.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.26,
      "end_seconds": 81.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.24,
      "end_seconds": 84.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.86,
      "end_seconds": 104.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.78,
      "end_seconds": 113.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.89,
      "text": "I've got an irregular heartbeat. I didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.44,
      "end_seconds": 125.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "yes, an irregular heartbeat is known to us, good to have that clear are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.24,
      "end_seconds": 130.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "no, not that that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.16,
      "end_seconds": 146.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "okay, are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.67,
      "end_seconds": 150.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.75,
      "end_seconds": 158.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.62,
      "end_seconds": 165.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.73,
      "end_seconds": 173.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.11,
      "end_seconds": 180.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "it's warfarin, in the evening for the blood thinning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.17,
      "end_seconds": 184.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "how much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.24,
      "end_seconds": 186.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "3 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 186.76,
      "end_seconds": 198.05,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier. Temp 36.4 degrees, pulse is 85 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, blood pressure 159 over 91."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.99,
      "end_seconds": 200.9,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.82,
      "end_seconds": 207.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.29,
      "end_seconds": 210.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.91,
      "end_seconds": 229.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Your right face droops, your right arm is weak and your speech is slurred."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.75,
      "end_seconds": 234.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.84,
      "end_seconds": 254.19,
      "duration_seconds": 12.35,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be a possible stroke, within the treatment window, or it might be a migraine with aura."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.23,
      "end_seconds": 258.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.26,
      "end_seconds": 293.38,
      "duration_seconds": 32.12,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible stroke, within the treatment window is my leading thought, not anything worse. An urgent CT scan of the head is what I'd like next, for possible stroke. Call an ambulance now, you need hospital immediately. I'm going to send a referral to the stroke team. We'll catch up straight away. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.3,
      "end_seconds": 300.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "So, I come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.19,
      "end_seconds": 306.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.15,
      "end_seconds": 311.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.07,
      "end_seconds": 313.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "see you soon"
    }
  ]
}